Changes made in this derivative (halt95, 2026). Every file below is modified or added relative to
halt95/Swift1.5-Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-W4A16-Merlin; the files not listed are byte-identical to that checkpoint's:
  - model-00001-of-00017.safetensors and model-00003-of-00017.safetensors through
    model-00015-of-00017.safetensors (14 shards; they hold the edited tensors) and the new EDITED_TENSORS.txt (the
    names of the 132 edited tensors). model.safetensors.index.json is unchanged: the edited tensors keep their names
    and shards.
    96 dense modules were changed by transplanting huihui-ai's abliteration onto
    Swift 1.5's weights: self_attn.o_proj (12 layers) and mlp.shared_expert.down_proj (48 layers) in BF16, and
    linear_attn.out_proj (36 GDN layers), re-packed to INT8 per-channel symmetric in the Merlin checkpoint's format
    (132 stored tensors in all). The edit was recovered from huihui-ai's weights as a rank-1 output-side projection
    per tensor (edited = (I - alpha r r^T) stock, against Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next revision
    de4b8e4d43b917e7706784d8bb445c9af86a3540; every fit within 1.25x the BF16 re-rounding floor) and applied as
    W' = bf16(W - alpha r r^T W) to Swift 1.5's tensor. Every other tensor, the routed experts included, is
    byte-identical to the Swift 1.5 W4A16 checkpoint's.
  - qsa_kv_scales_swift_huihui_dense.json: added to the checkpoint, and shipped in this repository as
    models/swift1.5-huihui/scales/qsa_kv_scales_swift_huihui_dense.json (the same bytes); static FP8 K/V scales calibrated on this checkpoint.
    This file is model-derived data, not Apache-2.0: it is subject to the Swift Open License v1.0 (models/swift1.5-huihui/licenses/Huihui-LICENSE)
    and the Qwen Community License 1.0 (models/swift1.5-huihui/licenses/LICENSE-QWEN), the same licences as the checkpoint it was calibrated on.
    It replaces the Swift 1.5 checkpoint's qsa_kv_scales_swift.json, which is not shipped.
  - The routed experts, the MTP draft head, the PLE table, model_extra_tensors.safetensors and every
    configuration file (config.json, quantization_config.json, generation_config.json, chat_template.jinja,
    tokenizer_config.json, preprocessor_config.json, processor_config.json) are unchanged.
  - In this repository, models/swift1.5-huihui/serve.sh, models/swift1.5-huihui/checkpoint.sha256,
